JOHNNY, get some rest. Rest up.

2410
01:10:41,506 --> 01:10:43,699
I'm gonna change and come out.
Get some rest.

2411
01:10:44,645 --> 01:10:45,507
Wow.

2412
01:10:46,132 --> 01:10:49,131
[Even loving the premium room]
Oh, this place is really nice.

2413
01:10:49,132 --> 01:10:50,432
Oh, wow!

2414
