2415
01:10:55,185 --> 01:10:58,098
[So excited…to open his suitcase for the first time]
Oh, I'm so excited, so excited.

2416
01:10:58,099 --> 01:10:59,299
I'm opening it
for the first time.

2417
01:10:59,977 --> 01:11:03,865
[As LEETEUK opens his tear-stained suitcase]
I feel like I'm gonna cry.

2418
01:11:04,205 --> 01:11:08,072
